{
  "dom_id": "question-342229",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "Select the missing parts in a particular solution of the differential equation ${y}^{′}-y=f(x),$ where the Fourier series of the $4$-periodic forcing function is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼-1+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{4}{{n}^{2}\\pi }\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{2}).\n$$\n\nThe Fourier series of a particular solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}_{p}∼{{field-1}} & +{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,{{field-2}}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{2}) \\\\  & +{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\,{{field-3}}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi x}{2})\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
